+## Ranged pressure and class recovery
+
+- In a mage or shadow-priest duel, begin a hard cast while a tactical retreat
+  spline is active and the pursuer is at least 18 yards away. Movement must stop
+  once, remain reserved long enough for the next decision to start the cast,
+  and resume only after the cast window or a new face-hug emergency. The log
+  should contain `ranged-cast-plant`, not alternating move/cancel every tick.
+- Activate a second talent page that contains a different rank of Mind Flay.
+  Spell-name resolution must select only a spell from the active spec; the
+  shadow rotation should maintain Vampiric Touch, Devouring Plague and Shadow
+  Word: Pain, channel Mind Flay, and use the wand only when spells are genuinely
+  unavailable.
+- Below 30% mana, give a mage a protected control window or at least 28 yards of
+  safe distance. It should plant and channel Evocation. With Mana Shield already
